B.P9=new A.H(B.c4,["echilibrat","Fel Principal",6,10,25,183,30,B.MO,"\u2022 907g file de pe\u0219te\n\u2022 1 lingur\u0103 suc de l\u0103m\xe2ie\n\u2022 60 ml lapte b\u0103tut f\u0103r\u0103 gr\u0103sime sau cu 1% gr\u0103sime\n\u2022 2 pic\u0103turi sos iute\n\u2022 1 linguri\u021b\u0103 usturoi tocat\n\u2022 \xbc linguri\u021b\u0103 piper alb\n\u2022 \xbc linguri\u021b\u0103 sare\n\u2022 \xbc linguri\u021b\u0103 ceap\u0103 pudr\u0103\n\u2022 aprox. 55 g pesmet uscat simplu\n\u2022 1 lingur\u0103 ulei vegetal\n\u2022 1 l\u0103m\xe2ie pentru servire","1. Pre\xeenc\u0103lze\u0219te cuptorul la aproximativ 245\xb0C. Strope\u0219te pe\u0219tele cu suc de l\u0103m\xe2ie \u0219i tamponeaz\u0103-l.\n2. Amestec\u0103 laptele b\u0103tut cu sosul iute \u0219i usturoiul. Separat combin\u0103 pesmetul cu piperul, sarea \u0219i ceapa.\n3. Trece pe\u0219tele prin lichid, apoi prin crust\u0103. A\u0219az\u0103-l \xeen tava uns\u0103 cu ulei.\n4. Coace pe raftul din mijloc 20 minute, f\u0103r\u0103 \xeentoarcere. Verific\u0103 g\u0103tirea \u0219i \xeemparte \xeen 6 por\u021bii; serve\u0219te cu l\u0103m\xe2ie.","Varianta cu pesmet este una dintre op\u021biunile din surs\u0103. Masa este o conversie orientativ\u0103.","https://www.nhlbi.nih.gov/health/heart-healthy-living/healthy-foods/healthy-eating-recipes/baked-fish","NHLBI / NIH","19.10.2026","Pe\u0219te, lapte \u0219i gr\xe2u. Verific\u0103 eticheta pesmetului.","",!0,"20.10.2026"],t.R)
