B.RU=new A.H(B.SD,["clasic","Fel Principal","Laura Lauren\u021biu","https://www.lauralaurentiu.ro/retete-culinare/retete-cu-paste/spaghetti-aglio-olio-peperoncino-reteta-clasica-de-spaghete-aop.html","RO","RO","20.10.2026",B.Kf,"\u2022 320\u2013350 g spaghete de gr\xe2u dur\n\u2022 60 ml ulei de m\u0103sline extravirgin\n\u2022 1 ardei iute ro\u0219u sau 2 mici\n\u2022 3\u20134 c\u0103\u021bei de usturoi\n\u2022 1\u20132 linguri p\u0103trunjel tocat\n\u2022 4 litri ap\u0103 \u0219i 1 lingur\u0103 sare pentru fierbere\n\u2022 Fulgi de chili, op\u021bional","1. Pune apa la fiert. Feliaz\u0103 usturoiul \u0219i ardeiul iute; \xeendep\u0103rteaz\u0103 semin\u021bele dac\u0103 dore\u0219ti mai pu\u021bin\u0103 iu\u021beal\u0103.\n2. Adaug\u0103 sarea \u0219i pastele \xeen apa clocotit\u0103. Fierbe-le cu un minut mai pu\u021bin dec\xe2t timpul de pe ambalaj; \xeen exemplul sursei, 8 minute \xeen loc de 9.\n3. \xcen paralel, \xeenc\u0103lze\u0219te uleiul cu usturoiul \u0219i ardeiul la foc foarte mic, p\xe2n\u0103 devin aromate \u0219i u\u0219or aurii, f\u0103r\u0103 s\u0103 se ard\u0103.\n4. Transfer\u0103 pastele \xeen tigaie cu un polonic de ap\u0103 de fierbere. Amestec\u0103 la foc mediu 1 minut; opre\u0219te \u0219i adaug\u0103 p\u0103trunjelul.","Timpul pastelor depinde de ambalaj. Ultimul minut se petrece \xeen tigaie; serve\u0219te imediat.","Gr\xe2u. Verific\u0103 ambalajul pastelor.",!0,4,5,10,15,!1,B.LD,400,5,34],t.R)
